## The Corrected Code

```java
public static double findMedian(int[] scores) {
    // Sort the array (a simple sort is fine here)
    java.util.Arrays.sort(scores);

    int middle = scores.length / 2;

    if (scores.length % 2 == 0) {
        // Even: average of the two middle elements
        return (scores[middle - 1] + scores[middle]) / 2.0;
    } else {
        // Odd: just the middle element
        return scores[middle];
    }
}
```

